^SAMPLE = GSM3508497
!Sample_title = Elesclomol 3
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM3508497
!Sample_status = Public on Mar 27 2019
!Sample_submission_date = Dec 11 2018
!Sample_last_update_date = Mar 29 2019
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = bone marrow
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Homo sapiens
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 9606
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: MM.1S
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = xenografts host mice: SCID-beige mice
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = agent: Elesclomol
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = Mice were randomly attributed a group of treatment (n=5 per group). Control group was IV injected once a week 200 uL saline solution; Bortezomib (0.25 mg/kg, 100 uL) was IP injected first day of the week, once a week until death of the animal. Elesclomol (25 mg/kg, 100 uL) was subcutaneously injected every 3rd day of the week until death of the animal. Elesclomol+Bortezomib group were treated similarly to previous groups. The delayed group started the Elesclomol treatment 14 days after the inclusion of the animal in the study. Endpoint of the study was dictated by either limb-paralysis of the animal or severe toxicity induced by the treatment as per Dana-Farber Animal policy.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = MM.1S gfp+/luc+ were cultivated in RPMI supplemented with 10% FBS and 1%P/S media. 3 millions cells were injected intravenously in SCID-beige mice. Mice were randomly included in the study when their tumors reached 10^7 radians intensity by BLI measurents.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = total RNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = At mice paralysis, a bone marrow flushing from the femurs was performed. Cell pelletS were then frozen at -80C upon collection of all samples and later RNA was extracted using Trizol.
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = TruSeq Stranded Total RNA Library Prep Kit with Ribo-Zero Gold following manufacturer’s instructions (Illumina RS-122-2301).
!Sample_data_processing = RNASeq reads were aligned using STAR (v2.5.4b )using default parameters (except --sjdbOverhang 39 ) to the human genome (GRCh37) with Ensembl annotation (GRCh37.87) in gtf format.
!Sample_data_processing = featureCounts (v1.6.1) was used with default parameters except for -s 2 (reversely stranded)
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: GRCh37
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Raw counts from featureCounts
!Sample_platform_id = GPL16791
